{"version":1,"key":"card:552","content":{"id":552,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关于信息源的建议："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做减法，削减信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们现在缺的不是信息，而是高质量的信息，我们的注意力有限，不要被低质量的信息浪费了时间，因此要削减这部分的信息源"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减利用情绪的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标题党，引发焦虑，带动情绪，扰乱正常规划和做事节奏"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减觉得舒适的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让人舒适的原因是什么，是因为观点和我们的看法相当一致，无法触发新的思考和改变了，此类信息源作用不大了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减缺乏事实依据的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"信息中充满了大量的观点，暴论，但是缺乏事实依据，缺乏数据支撑，不可靠"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做加法，增加书本之外的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们获取高质量信息源的方式，最快的方式就是从书本、论文获取，但不可作为唯一的获取信息源的方式，书也有一些问题，从写作到出版，最少一年，对于一些日新月异的领域来说，太晚了，另外有一些是书中不会提的，需要在实践中总结的"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"他人作为信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从真正的实践者获取信息，多请教多观察，注意以下三点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注细节，真正的实践者不会阐述宏大叙事，而是细节间的微妙联系"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注失败，有的时候成功是天时地利人和，很难复制，但是失败都是有具体原因的，要吸取这些经验，少走弯路"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注一手信息源，别看二手解读的文章，直接去看他人的演讲，文章，博客，报告"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"亲自下场"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"亲自去观察，去调研，去总结经验，投入时间、投入精力，有的时候觉得自己准备充足了，但是下场才知道不了解的问题层出不穷，一定要亲身经历才有深刻感悟"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做乘法，多个角度考察信息"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑概念"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个信息当我们向下挖，深入到某一个概念时，会发现我们对其一无所知，通过深挖概念我们可以对信息理解更准确"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考察范式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向上抽象看，找到可迁移的范式，别的领域的经验也可以成为本领域的解决方案，警惕范式不是假大空的大话，而是方法和思路"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"顺藤摸瓜"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"优质信息源的其他信息相对也是较为优质的，所参考的资料大概率也是优质的，顺藤摸瓜，汲取这些优质的信息源"}]}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["读书/笔记的方法","学习方法"],"createTime":1743919240783,"updateTime":1743919295897,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743919295897}}